    "http": "# v1 API — Generated from OpenAPI spec\n\n@host = http://localhost/api\n@token = Bearer {{token}}\n\n### Get user\nReturns user by ID\nGET {{host}}/v1/template/getUser?id=\n\n### Create user\nCreates a new user\nPOST {{host}}/v1/template/createUser\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nname=&email=\n",
    "markdown": "# Template API\nAPI with response templates (v1)\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost/api`\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [template](#template)\n\n## template\n\n### Get user\nReturns user by ID\n\n`GET /v1/template/getUser`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `id` | integer | Yes | User ID |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Create user\nCreates a new user\n\n`POST /v1/template/createUser`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | string | Yes | User name |\n| `email` | string | Yes | User email |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n",
    "curl": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Template API\nAPI with response templates (v1) — cURL examples\n# Auto-generated from OpenAPI spec. Do not edit manually.\n\nBASE_URL=\"http://localhost/api\"\nTOKEN=\"${API_TOKEN:-}\"\n\n# Get user\nReturns user by ID\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/template/getUser?id=\"\n\n# Create user\nCreates a new user\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"name=\" \\\n  -d \"email=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/template/createUser\"\n",
    "bruno": "meta {\n  name: Get user Returns user by ID\n  type: http\n  seq: 1\n}\n\nget {\n  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/template/getUser?id=\n  body: none\n  auth: none\n}\n\nparams:query {\n  id:\n}\n\nmeta {\n  name: Create user Creates a new user\n  type: http\n  seq: 2\n}\n\npost {\n  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/template/createUser\n  body: form-urlencoded\n  auth: none\n}\n\nbody:form-urlencoded {\n    name: \n    email: \n}\n",
    "bruno files": {
        "bruno.json": "{\n    \"version\": \"1\",\n    \"name\": \"Template API\\nAPI with response templates v1\",\n    \"type\": \"collection\",\n    \"ignore\": [\n        \"node_modules\",\n        \".git\"\n    ]\n}\n",
